ence: The middleware directly addresses the Article 12 mandate to automatically record events and timestamps for high-risk systems. -> 4\n\nEffectiveness_evidence: If implemented, it would automate event capture and reduce manual burden, though it may need extension for all Annex III specific data fields. -> 3? Need one sentence.\n\nParadigm_relatedness_evidence: It introduces a new logging tool and process but keeps compliance as a separate logging practice rather than redefining R&D. -> 2\n\nOriginality_evidence: Unified logging middleware is a common, mundane industry solution for regulatory traceability. ->1\n\nReturn.\n\n",
