iginality evidence: Automated CI/CD-driven compliance reports are a common DevOps practice and not rare or surprising in regulated R&D.\nScore 1.\n\nImplementability evidence: Building a CI/CD trigger that parses existing logs into report templates requires integration work but is a reasonably feasible engineering effort.\nScore 3.\n\nAcceptability evidence: Automating documentation generation is a standard, legally neutral business practice that does not offend norms.\nScore 4.\n\nReturn JSON? Probably plain text. Provide id and ratings.\n\nOutput format requested: echo id exactly. For each subscale give <subscale>_evidence first then <subscale>. Could be key-value.\n\nI'll produce:\n\nid: P2955\napplicability_evidence: ...\napplicability: 4\n...\n\nLet's do that.\n\n",
